\par
~\f5\lang1032\'d6\f3\u8593?\f1  \f3\u8594?\f1  \f3\u10207?\f1  \f0 (return to center before rising)\par
\par
Take a 7-day "mini-cycle" to reset.\par
\par
Then continue with Phase \f5\lang1032\'d6\f3\u8593?\f1  \f0 when ready.\par
\par
Disruption Type 2: Phase Stall\par
What happens:\par
\par
You're stuck in a phase.\par
\par
Days 105-156 of \f5\lang1032\'d8 (Insight) but you can't generate insights.\par
\par
Blocked. Confused.\par
\par
Recovery:\par
\par
This often means you need to descend before ascending.\par
\par
Use LAMAGUE: \'d8 \f4\u9661?\f1\lang1033  \f5\lang1032\'d8 (dive deeper into insight)\par
\par
Don't skip the phase. Intensify it.\par
\par
Go deeper, not wider.\par
\par
Spend an extra week in contemplation.\par
\par
Then the insight will come.\par
\par
Disruption Type 3: Phase Backlash\par
What happens:\par
\par
You complete Phase \'d6\f3\u8593?\f1  \f0 (Rise) successfully but then collapse into ~\f5\lang1032\'d6\f3\u8593?\f1  \f0 (fall).\par
\par
Burnout. Crash. Regression.\par
\par
Why this happens:\par
\par
You rose too fast. The invariant wasn't ready for the new height.\par
\par
Recovery:\par
\par
Go directly to Phase \f3\u10226?\f1  \f0 (Return) \f1\emdash  even if it's early.\par
\par
Spend extra time in Phase \f3\u8741?\f4\u9665?\u9655?\f3\u8741?\f1  \f0 (Integrity) protecting your gains.\par
\par
Use LAMAGUE: \f5\lang1032\'d6\f3\u8593?\f1  \f3\u8594?\f1  \f3\u10226?\f1  \f0 (early) to force completion.\par
\par
Then begin Cycle 2 more slowly.\par
